[00:42:39.600 --> 00:42:42.600]  And He was raised
[00:42:42.600 --> 00:42:46.600]  To overflow the grave
[00:42:46.600 --> 00:42:49.600]  For this I hold
[00:42:49.600 --> 00:42:54.600]  My sin has been defeated
[00:42:54.600 --> 00:43:01.600]  Jesus now and ever is my plea
[00:43:01.600 --> 00:43:05.600]  All the chains are released
[00:43:05.600 --> 00:43:08.600]  I can sing I am free
[00:43:08.600 --> 00:43:15.600]  Yet not I, but through Christ in me
[00:43:17.600 --> 00:43:21.600]  With every breath
[00:43:21.600 --> 00:43:25.600]  I long to follow Jesus
[00:43:25.600 --> 00:43:28.600]  For He has said
[00:43:28.600 --> 00:43:32.600]  That He will bring me home
[00:43:32.600 --> 00:43:35.600]  And day by day
[00:43:35.600 --> 00:43:39.600]  I know He will renew me
[00:43:39.600 --> 00:43:42.600]  Until I stand
[00:43:42.600 --> 00:43:47.600]  With joy before the throne
[00:43:47.600 --> 00:43:49.600]  To this I hold
[00:43:49.600 --> 00:43:54.600]  My hope is only Jesus
[00:43:54.600 --> 00:44:01.600]  All the glory evermore to Him
[00:44:01.600 --> 00:44:05.600]  When the race is complete
[00:44:05.600 --> 00:44:08.600]  Still my lips shall repeat
[00:44:08.600 --> 00:44:11.600]  Yet not I, but through Christ in me
[00:44:11.600 --> 00:44:13.600]  To this I hold
[00:44:13.600 --> 00:44:19.600]  我們將一生的寄望
[00:44:19.600 --> 00:44:22.600]  放在耶穌身上
[00:44:22.600 --> 00:44:24.600]  我們將我們的生命
[00:44:24.600 --> 00:44:27.600]  成為祂榮耀的器皿
[00:44:27.600 --> 00:44:31.600]  一天我們會完成我們的賽事
[00:44:31.600 --> 00:44:36.600]  但我們仍然要讚美祂
[00:44:36.600 --> 00:44:43.600]  Yet not I, but through Christ in me
[00:44:43.600 --> 00:44:46.600]  When the race is complete
[00:44:46.600 --> 00:44:50.600]  Still my lips shall repeat
[00:44:50.600 --> 00:44:59.600]  Yet not I, but through Christ in me
